<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύ̆-ρροπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turning quickly,</i> prop.
			of a delicate balance : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. πρὸς
				τὰς ὀργάς</span>
			<i>sudden and quick</i> to anger, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				144a
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὀργήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.65d
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦς ὀ. πρὸς τὰς μιαιφονίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Memn.
					2
				</span></i>
			 ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. θυμός</span>
			<i>unstable</i> temper, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				411b
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὀ. τῆς πεύσεως</span>
			<i>rapidity</i> or <i>vehemence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				18.1
			</span></i> ; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξυρεπής.</span>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					50.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
